# Never needed inside the build context — cuts context size and image layers.
.git
.github
node_modules
dist

# Root-level one-off debug/trigger scripts — not imported by the build, only
# ever run manually against a live deployment. Anchored to root so it doesn't
# also exclude scripts/*.mjs (some of those are real npm scripts).
/*.mjs

# Sample/demo assets, not part of the app.
attached_assets
fastvid_demo.mp4

# Local dev artifacts.
.env
.env.*
*.log
uploads
.claude
.vscode
.idea

# Agent tooling's own DB-query debug logs (see .gitignore) — must never end up in a build
# context either, in case a local checkout regenerates them before they're committed.
.manus

# Test/scratch output that shouldn't leak into the image.
tsc_errors*.txt
vitest_new*.json
todo.md

# The Python clip-extraction service builds from its own Dockerfile (root dir
# services/ytdlp-download) and has nothing to do with the Node image.
#
# RONDE 236: this said `ytdlp-service`, a second copy of the service that was left behind when the
# live one moved to services/ytdlp-download. That copy is deleted — see the round's commit for why
# a dormant duplicate of the egress path is worth removing rather than leaving to rot.
services/ytdlp-download
